  "verdict": "EXPLORATORY_CANDIDATE if W0-W8 all pass; INCONCLUSIVE if W0 fails; otherwise EXPLORATORY_REJECT. Exploratory because every review was inspected before; given that inspection a candidate is the expected outcome if a short hold is chosen and adds little new support. A candidate licenses only a frozen prospective paper protocol from MSCI's next review; never a live promotion and never evidence of future profit. A reject or an inconclusive result ends this family's search on history. One run; no other grid, plan, event set or window."
